; [rune floor demo] Design canvas concept A as a playable combat loop. The world
; takes the whole 1080 x 1920 screen; the invoker dock floats over the bottom
; band and a thin title bar over the top. The real SlotMachine lives in
; HiddenCabinet, never drawn - RuneFloor mirrors its board onto the ground.

