; [rune floor dock] Design A of the dock mockups (2026-09-26): one plate per
; hero, health on top, portrait in a segmented charge ring, the special's name in
; a pill; the whole plate is the special's button. Replaces the Meshy invoker tray
; and the HP strip under it, whose text read at 7-9 pt on a phone.
